line=175 phase=commentary text='The validation artifacts are now reproducible: a 19,614-case CPython differential test with an independently written scanner, a K LLVM smoke program covering both prompt examples and edge cases, and two expected-failure K probes. I’m running the exact `prove.sh` end to end now; after that I’ll reconstruct the extension inventory from the final files and write the gate-by-gate `PROOF.md`.'
